Short:        IDE for vbcc, vasm and ACE BASIC (MUI)
Author:       Ronny Krueger
Uploader:     amitools@planet-rk.de (Ronny Krueger)
Type:         dev/misc
Version:      @VERSION@
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0.0
Requires:     MUI 3.8, reqtools, regex.library, NList, TextEditor, vbcc
Distribution: Aminet

AmigaIDE is an integrated development environment for AmigaOS 3.x with
a MUI interface, for C, assembler and ACE BASIC projects built with
vbcc, vasm and vlink:

  - projects with C, assembler and BASIC sources, SDK selection
  - editor with syntax highlighting, indentation, bookmarks
  - symbol index, go to definition, references, project-wide search
  - build and clean through GNU make, error list with jump to source
  - Autodoc help (F1) for every active SDK, struct layouts
  - disassembler for hunk files, memory map after a build
  - Workbench icons for built programs
  - version control with AmiVCS (commit, branches, merge, history
    graph, push/pull/clone), if AmiVCS 0.6 or newer is installed

The same project files (.aproj) open in the Qt version of the IDE on
macOS, Linux and Windows (AmiDevIDE, cross-development with the same
toolchain).

Installation
------------
Unpack the archive and double-click "Install-AmiDevIDE" (Commodore
Installer). Without the Installer:  CD AmiDevIDE  and
Execute Install-AmiDevIDE.shell [ZIEL=Work:]
The drawer AmigaIDE also runs from wherever you drag it.

Requirements
------------
- AmigaOS 3.x, 68020 or better, no FPU needed
- MUI 3.8 or newer (util/libs/mui38usr.lha)
- reqtools.library (util/libs/ReqToolsUsr.lha)
- regex.library 5.x, the POSIX one by Alfonso Ranieri
  (util/libs/regex_ranieri.lha). Not the unrelated GNU regex.library 1.0
  from util/libs/Regex.lha, which has the same name.
- MUI classes NList, NListview, NListtree (dev/mui/MCC_NList-0.128.lha)
  and TextEditor (dev/mui/MCC_TextEditor-15.56.lha)
To build programs:
- vbcc with vasm and vlink (dev/c/vbcc_bin_amigaos68k.lha) and the
  vbcc target m68k-amigaos (http://sun.hasenbraten.de/vbcc/)
- NDK 3.2 (dev/misc/NDK3.2.lha), GNU make (dev/c/make-4.4.1.lha)
- for BASIC projects ACE BASIC (dev/basic/ace-basic.lha)
Optional:
- AmiVCS 0.6 or newer for version control (dev/misc/AmiVCS.lha)

Status
------
Experimental software, developed with the help of Claude (an AI
assistant by Anthropic) and written primarily for the author's own use.
Try it with copies of your data first; use at your own risk.

Documentation and user interface are in German.
Die Dokumentation (AmigaIDE/AmigaIDE.guide) und die Oberfläche sind
deutsch.

History
-------
0.4  note on the experimental status, no program changes
0.3  manual updated; the installer reports a wrong start directory
0.2  version control with AmiVCS; a first push asks for the repository
     name on the server; project files read and written independent of
     the locale; directory requester fixes (current directory, paths
     right below a volume)
0.1  first release

